<title>JAPAN: Avon Products - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Avon Products - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.65		vs	   14.12</p>
<p> Operating   loss 849    million    vs   loss 161    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 825    million    vs    loss 83    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 815    million    vs    loss 82    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 13.11 yen	  vs     loss 1.32 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     62 million	  vs	  62 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Avon Products Co Ltd produces and sells cosmetics in Japan.</p>
</text>
